Apply the Harbor installation steps above?
  - Install release 0.18.2 to /opt/harbor
  - Create system user harbor (nologin) and add it to the docker group (root-equivalent authority)
  - Ensure /etc/harbor (root:harbor 0750), /var/lib/harbor (harbor 0700) and the data folder /srv/harbor (harbor 0755)
  - Write /etc/harbor/harbor.json (listen 127.0.0.1:18000, app ports 18080-18999, socket /var/run/docker.sock)
  - Initialize fresh state in /var/lib/harbor
  - Enroll the local administrator (admin)
  - Install systemd unit harbor.service and (re)start it
  (approved with --yes)
